Package: BayesIRTplot
Title: Generate Plots for Bayesian IRT Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Karina", "Cahill", email = "karina.cahill@asu.edu", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Roy", "Levy", email = "Roy.Levy@asu.edu", role = c("aut")),
    person("Yadi", "Li", email = "yadili@asu.edu", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Use for generating plots for Bayesian IRT analysis conducted in blavaan. 
    The following types of plots are available: 
    Item-Person Map, Item Characteristic Curve, Item Information Curve, Test Characteristic Curve, Test Information Curve, 
    Reliability Plot.
